BT /F2 13.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 50.00 670.89 Tm (1. Reference text) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 62.00 653.62 Tm (- Law No. 09-08 on the protection of individuals with regard to the processing of personal) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 62.00 637.34 Tm (data.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 62.00 620.07 Tm (- Promulgated by dahir No. 1-09-15 of 18 February 2009.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 62.00 602.79 Tm (- Published in Official Bulletin No. 5714 of 5 March 2009.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 62.00 585.52 Tm (- Supervisory authority: CNDP \(National Commission for the Control of Personal Data) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 62.00 569.24 Tm (Protection\).) Tj ET
BT /F2 13.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 50.00 534.32 Tm (2. Principles applicable to customer support) Tj ET
BT /F2 9.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 518.37 Tm (Principle | Application at NovaShop) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 502.42 Tm (Determined purpose | Each collection is tied to a documented purpose \(POL-06\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 486.47 Tm (Proportionality | Collect only the data needed for processing) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 470.52 Tm (Limited retention | Retention periods defined per data type) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 454.57 Tm (Security and confidentiality | Encryption, role-based access, logging) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 438.62 Tm (Information of data subjects | Privacy policy accessible and readable) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 422.67 Tm (Consent | Required for marketing and non-essential cookies) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 406.72 Tm (Data subject rights | Access, rectification, objection, erasure) Tj ET
BT /F1 4.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 50.00 400.52 Tm () Tj ET
BT /F2 13.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 50.00 365.59 Tm (3. Declaratory obligations) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 50.00 345.32 Tm (The processing of personal data is subject to formalities with the CNDP. Support must not) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 50.00 329.04 Tm (state that a processing operation is "declared" or "compliant" without verification by the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 50.00 312.77 Tm (DPO.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 50.00 292.49 Tm (Point of attention: the existence, number and scope of a CNDP declaration must be confirmed) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 50.00 276.22 Tm (before any communication. No fictional declaration number may be published.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 50.00 241.29 Tm (4. Sensitive data) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 50.00 221.02 Tm (The law strictly regulates sensitive data \(health, origin, opinions, religion, biometric) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 50.00 204.74 Tm (data\). NovaShop does not collect any.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 50.00 184.47 Tm (If a customer spontaneously communicates sensitive data in a support exchange, the agent must:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 62.00 167.19 Tm (1. not record it in the ticket description field;) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 62.00 149.92 Tm (2. not reuse it;) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 62.00 132.64 Tm (3. refer the customer to the DPO if necessary.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 50.00 97.72 Tm (5. Transfers and subcontracting) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 50.00 77.44 Tm (Any subcontractor processing data on behalf of NovaShop must provide sufficient guarantees.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 50.00 61.17 Tm (Transfers outside Morocco must be covered by appropriate contractual safeguards.) Tj ET
